uad\nf''(x)=\\frac{x-1}{x^2}.\n\\]\n\n**(1)** For \\(a=1\\), \\(f'(1)=1\\). Hence the tangent line is\n\\[\ny-f(1)=f'(1)(x-1),\\quad\\text{so }y=x-1.\n\\]\n\n**(2)** If \\(f(x)>0\\) for every \\(x>1\\), then\n\\[\n2-a=f'(1)=\\lim_{x\\to1^+}\\frac{f(x)}{x-1}\\ge0,\n\\]\nso necessarily \\(a\\le2\\).\n\nConversely, if \\(a\\le2\\), then \\(f'(1)=2-a\\ge0\\). Since \\(f''(x)>0\\) for \\(x>1\\), we have \\(f'(x)>0\\) there. Thus \\(f(x)>f(1)=0\\) for every \\(x>1\\). Therefore \\(a\\le2\\) is also sufficient.\n\nFinal answer: (1) \\(y=x-1\\). (2) \\(a\\in(-\\infty,2]\\)."}],"phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"presence_penalty":0,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_retention":"24h","reasoning":{"context":"all_turns","effort":"medium","mode":"standard","summary":null},"safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"default","store":false,"temperature":1,"text":{"format":{"type":"text"},"verbosity":"medium"},"tool_choice":"auto","tool_usage":{"image_gen":{"input_tokens":0,"input_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"total_tokens":0},"web_search":{"num_requests":0}},"tools":[],"top_logprobs":0,"top_p":0.98,"truncation":"disabled","usage":{"input_tokens":175,"input_tokens_details":{"cache_write_tokens":0,"cached_tokens":0},"output_tokens":477,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":181},"total_tokens":652},"user":null,"metadata":{}}
